ExcaliburDB OCR module

This module contains a Java port of Indra OCR (https://github.com/datalab-to/indra), version
1.1.2, by Datalab, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The port translates Indra's
Python inference code - page rendering, line detection and recognition, reading order, layout and
markdown - to Java; each ported source file names the Indra module it was translated from.

Indra's model weights are not part of this module or of any ExcaliburDB distribution. A node
configured to use them downloads them from https://huggingface.co/datalab-to/indra-ocr, where
they are published under their own licence, the AI Pubs Open RAIL-M License (Modified), whose
use restrictions apply to whoever downloads and uses them.

